cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Cytometry Batch Assessment
abstract: Measures batch effects in a flow or mass cytometry cohort with the Earth Mover's Distance per
  batch and marker, and flags batches and markers above a robust threshold with scores, heatmaps and density
  plots. Run it before and after a correction to see whether the correction helped.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-cytometry-batch-assess
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- fcs
- batch-effects
- quality-control
